  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Voluntary Contribution the CERF Climate Action Account for 2025.The CERF Climate Action Account (CCAA) utilies the global reach and speed of the CERF to deliver faster, more cost-effective climate-related humanitarian action. CERF supported collective anticipatory action frameworks have demonstrated their potential to catalyze climate adaption and affected communities.&#xa0;Similar to the CERF, the Climate Action Account responds to crises as and when they occur, responding to both sudden onset and underfunded emergencies.</narrative>
  </description>
